# Touch screens: swipe through the image picker (backgrounds, themes), fit it
# to a narrow screen, and hold the desktop for the Style menu (there is no
# right button or keyboard shortcut on a phone).
#
# Against Omarchy 4.0.4 (edge 4.0.4-2; tag v4.0.4) with 0000 (Commons.Color)
# applied: only the context of the picker's size properties differs from
# upstream main.
# 2026-11-06: style menu summons appearance via shell IPC now, picker responsive sizes — regenerated against Omarchy 4.5.0-3, same
# semantic change (the previous revision carries the 4.4-era hunks).


--- a/shell/plugins/background/Background.qml
